         NaOCl  1 GPH -> 0.063 L/min
         HCl    2 GPH -> 0.126 L/min
         NaCl   no continuous rate is sourced - brine regeneration is a batch
                duty, not continuous metering. Held at the 1 GPH class pending
                grounding; tracked in RESEARCH_NEEDED.md.
       profiles/demo.yaml keeps rate_lpm: 5.0 for visible demo drain. *)
    CHEM_TANK_MAX : REAL := 1000.0;   (* [mm], FDS *)
    NACL_DOSE_LPM : REAL := 0.063;
    NAOCL_DOSE_LPM : REAL := 0.063;
    HCL_DOSE_LPM : REAL := 0.126;

    (* --- State variables (wt-p1-raw-water.md: State Variables) --- *)
